### List Users
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get User
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Invite User
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/invite
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "username": "johndoe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "role": "OPERATOR"
}

### Change Role
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/1/role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### Block User
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/1/block
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Unblock User
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/1/unblock
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
